message: "If you use this research, please cite the technical report and the repository release used in your work."
title: "Lossless Executable Materialization Across an LLM Host Boundary"
type: report
authors:
  - family-names: "Fujii"
    given-names: "Jumpei"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jumpesan/lossless-executable-materialization"
url: "https://github.com/jumpesan/lossless-executable-materialization"
version: "0.1-preliminary"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
abstract: >-
  Preliminary research on verifiable lossless executable materialization across an
  LLM-host boundary, emerging from experiments that combine structured Context,
  deterministic Scripts, and a general-purpose ChatGPT/LLM host as an
  application-like runtime.
keywords:
  - LLM
  - AI agents
  - artifact integrity
  - executable materialization
  - content identity
  - sandbox
  - reproducibility
  - software supply chain
